  "notes": "New\n- Habits can now repeat on the weekdays you choose, such as Monday to Friday or weekends only. Streaks, alerts and statistics only count the days a habit is due.\n- On Android, habit alerts have a \"Mark done\" button, so you can check a habit off right from the notification.\n- Tapping a reminder or habit notification now opens the app right at that item and highlights it.\n\nImproved\n- Settings is easier to browse: options are grouped into General, Alerts, Focus and Money & data, each row shows its current value, and a tap opens its options right below it.\n- Moving your main tabs is easier: drag a tab by its handle and it moves right away, or use the arrows.\n- Resetting your main tabs now asks you to confirm first, so you don't lose your arrangement by accident.",
